<section class="section-tight" style="background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1 style="font-size:2.1rem">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width:680px">How we collect, use, and protect your personal information on baselineskills.com.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:#fff">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px">
    <div style="color:var(--text);line-height:1.75;font-size:.98rem">

      <p>Our website is structured in such a way that you can visit www.baselineskills.com largely without the need to identify yourself. We also provide professional resources to its user members through our web site and electronic newsletters. In providing these resources, we require registration and respects the privacy rights of its members. We assure you that your personal information will only be used for the purpose in which it was submitted. This purpose will be clearly stated on our registration form, and will comply with all applicable privacy laws in India.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top:36px">Our Commitment to Privacy</h2>
      <p>Your privacy is important to us. To better protect your privacy, we provide this notice explaining our online information practices and the choices you can make about the way your information is collected and used. To make this notice easy to find, we make it available on our website and at every point where personally identifiable information may be requested.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top:36px">The Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>This notice applies to all information collected or submitted on the Baseline Skills website. On some pages, you can order products, make requests, and register to view or receive materials. The types of personal information collected on these pages are:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left:22px">
        <li>Name</li>
        <li>Company</li>
        <li>Job Title</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Phone number (optional)</li>
        <li>Address (used for those registering for classes)</li>
        <li>Credit/Debit Card Information (we don't keep this information; used one time only for class registration and purchasing products)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>On some pages, you can submit information about other people. For example, if you register another person for a class, you will need to submit the recipient's address and email. In this circumstance, the types of personal information collected are:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left:22px">
        <li>Student name</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Address</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top:36px">The Way We Use Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information you provide to provide resources and news relevant to our industry and company, to communicate with you, to complete transactions requested by you, and to update and offer you services provided by Baseline Skills. We do not share or sell this information with outside parties.</p>
      <p>We use the information you provide about you or about someone else when placing an order only to ship the product and to confirm delivery. We do not share this information with outside parties except to the extent necessary to complete that order.</p>
      <p>We use return email addresses to answer the email we receive. These addresses are also used to provide an electronic newsletter to those who register for this service. Such addresses are not used for any other purpose and are not shared with outside parties.</p>
      <p>You can register on our website if you would like to access and download resources provided by Vellicate and get updates on our products and services. Information about you will not be used unless you fill out the registration form on our website.</p>
      <p>We use non-identifying and aggregate information to better design our website and provide the most appropriate resources to our members.</p>
      <p>Finally, we never use or share the personally identifiable information provided to us online in ways unrelated to the ones described above without also providing you an opportunity to opt-out or otherwise prohibit such unrelated uses.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top:36px">Our Commitment to Data Security</h2>
      <p>To prevent unauthorized access, maintain data accuracy, and ensure the correct use of information, we have put in place appropriate physical, electronic, and managerial procedures to safeguard and secure the information we collect online. We use secure socket layer (SSL) protection for our web pages. We never store credit card information that is used to purchase classes or products.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top:36px">How You Can Access or Correct Your Information</h2>
      <p>We provide each member the ability to access personally identifiable information that we collect through www.baselineskills.com. As a member, you can change this information at any time by logging into your account. We use this procedure to better safeguard your information. If you want us to delete any of your data, please contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@baselineskills.com">contact@baselineskills.com</a>.</p>
      <p>To protect your privacy and security, we will also take reasonable steps to verify your identity before granting access or making corrections.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top:36px">How to Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Should you have questions or concerns about these privacy policies, please send us an email at <a href="mailto:contact@baselineskills.com">contact@baselineskills.com</a>.</p>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

